OL,3,AUK economy grows at fastest rate for
OL,4,Amore than two years
OL,5,
OL,6,Fo;?The UK economy grew at its fastest
OL,7,Frate for more than two years in the
OL,8,Fthree months to September.
OL,10,FBetween July and September, the economy
OL,11,Fexpanded by 0.7%, accelerating from the
OL,12,Fprevious three months, official figures
OL,13,Fshow.
OL,15,FThe robust growth suggests a far more
OL,16,Fresilient economy than expected over
OL,17,Fthe summer, despite the impact of
OL,18,Fhigher energy prices from the Iran war.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
