OL,3,ANvidia CEO Jensen Huang resigns after
OL,4,Atech giant rocked by second affair
OL,5,Aallegation
OL,6,
OL,7,FOn Sunday, Huang admitted an affair
OL,8,Fwith a woman, reportedly from another
OL,9,Fcompany - she was also allegedly a
OL,10,FChinese spy
OL,12,FBeijing has warned the US not to use
OL,13,Fthe spying allegations as a pretext to
OL,14,Fonce again restrict tech sales to China
OL,16,FNvidia is already investigating the
OL,17,Faffair Huang has admitted, as is the
OL,18,FFBI. What does Nvidia's code of conduct
OL,19,Fsay?
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
