OL,3,AEight killed and at least 17 injured in
OL,4,ANew York building collapse as rescuers
OL,5,Ascour wreckage
OL,6,
OL,7,FAt least eight people have died after a
OL,8,Fthree-storey building collapsed on
OL,9,FWednesday in Brooklyn
OL,11,FIn a statement, New York City's mayor
OL,12,FZohran Mamdani says at least 17 more
OL,13,Fpeople, including three firefighters,
OL,14,Fhave been injured - read his update in
OL,15,Ffull
OL,17,FThe city's fire department says four of
OL,18,Fthe injured are in hospital in a
OL,19,Fcritical condition
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
